agraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"How do you mention a date? :: Type @ and pick one"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edit the question or answer whenever you like. A card keeps its schedule as long as its question stays the same."}]}]},"s11":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing leaves your computer"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Morrow has no servers. It never phones home, has no analytics and no AI. The only time it uses the network is when you ask it to: loading a picture from the web, or syncing with your own devices."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your vault"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your notes live in a vault, a normal folder. Open it from the vault menu at the top of the sidebar, or with "},{"type":"text","text":"Show in folder","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" in a page’s menu. You can edit the files in any app while Morrow is open and it follows along. Keep the folder in a backup or a synced drive if you like."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Page history"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Morrow keeps earlier versions of a page as you work. Choose "},{"type":"text","text":"Page history","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" from the page menu to see what changed, line by line, and bring back any version."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Password protected pages"}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"start":1},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose "},{"type":"text","text":"Encrypt with a password","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" from a page’s menu."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 